  "limits": [
    "Completion means that every block in the recorded coarse-guided core plan was processed, and every nonempty native-grid NBE1 artifact has a recorded full public-GET checksum verification. The guide derives from the cleaned 79.4 micrometre prior. The reconstructed scalar field combines denoised 19.85 micrometre native samples near the guide with a smooth transition to that prior farther away. Native-only, blended and prior-only counts describe stored edge crossings, including duplicates on shared tile boundaries; they are not disjoint surface-area fractions or a measure of complete anatomical coverage. Native-only structures absent from the prior outside the searched band may be missing. The overview is a separately sampled and simplified display LOD. The 0.31015625 micrometre native crossing-encoding bound is relative to the processed scalar isosurface; it does not bound denoising, registration, prior-guidance or anatomical error.",
